        "Performance Features",
        "1. High recovery rate for fine‑grained fractions, low mechanical entrainment and high concentrate grade.\n2. Capable of operating under relatively high pulp concentration.\n3. Well‑suited for computerized control.\n4. High froth enrichment ratio.\n5. Suitable for treating micro‑fine mineral particles.",
        "",
